/-!
# The two ATLAS matrices for the cubic G₂(3) witness

The entries are transcribed from the two degree-27 matrices over GF(7),
with rows and columns in the order of the original MeatAxe files. This
module asserts no identities or recognition theorem. The unmodified inputs,
hashes, source URLs and an exploratory calculation are retained in `source/`.

Source: R. A. Wilson, S. J. Nickerson and J. N. Bray, *ATLAS of Finite Group
Representations*, https://brauer.maths.qmul.ac.uk/Atlas/v3/matrep/3G23G1-f7r27B0,
retrieved 9 October 2026. This is numerical data transcription; no code is
ported from the local ATLAS project.
-/

